module fixture.native_cli_door.door_probe

// THE V2-NATIVE CLI'S POSITIVE CONTROL, AND THE REASON IT IS ITS OWN SOURCE ROOT.
//
// `//gunbc/instruments:v2-native-cli` emits and BUILDS `v2.cli.compile_cli`; until the step that
// consumes this file landed, that was the whole instrument -- the door compiled and was never
// walked through, which DESIGN section 5 names as specification-without-execution: a green that
// establishes the closure typechecks and nothing about whether the program runs. This file is the
// argv the built binary is handed so that it does run: `emit --entry
// fixture.native_cli_door.door_probe --source-root fixtures/native_cli_door`.
//
// IT HAS NO IMPORTS, for the same reason `fixture.closure.rustc_green_probe` has none: the
// admission's subject resolves against the validated roots the ingest produced, so a module whose
// closure is itself is the SMALLEST subject that still walks argv parse, source-root read, ingest,
// resolution and emission end to end. A subject with imports would add nothing to what the door
// decides and would make a red attributable to the import graph rather than to the door.
//
// IT IS ITS OWN DIRECTORY AND NOT A FILE IN AN EXISTING FIXTURE ROOT, because the CLI's source
// root is walked RECURSIVELY for every `.dag` file under it; sharing a directory would make the
// control's ingest a function of what some other fixture's author adds next to it.
//
// THE DECLARATION'S NAME AND VALUE ARE WHAT THE CONTROL READS. v2 lowers this `data` declaration to
// a named member whose body is the literal, and the door refuses that body at translate
// (`translate_arrow_body_not_a_type_expression`) rather than printing the member as its type with the
// value dropped, which it did briefly on 2026-09-23. So the emit arm expects that refusal by name; an
// exit 0 must emit Rust naming `native_cli_door_probe_value` AND carrying `606060`, and doing so is
// the instruction to flip the arm back into an emission control.
//
// The declaration is deliberately trivial: one literal of a kernel type, with no imports.
data native_cli_door_probe_value: Int = 606060
